[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4502.79, "timestamp": "01:15:02", "text": "。離我遠點。逃離。哦，其實他的聲音變了。哦，你真醜。  你長得醜。你長得醜。不，你很醜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4508.149, "timestamp": "01:15:08", "text": "你還好嗎？我勒個去？不，我已經死了。我死了。我死了。我不能讓自己看起來很醜，老兄。兄弟，這真是太好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4530.87, "timestamp": "01:15:30", "text": "。歡迎。不，你已經飛走了。你簡直炸開了鍋。你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4543.99, "timestamp": "01:15:43", "text": "身體爆炸了，頭直接掉進推車裡了。感覺就像在問：你在嗎？不，他就在我面前。他在購物車裡。看看車上有多少人。你總是把他放在那裡。喔不，她不是。  這也太快了吧！  是的，他會跑步。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4547.307, "timestamp": "01:15:47", "author": "@Back2005", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TUs_4eRxRjlVzlXUYnX60TXdeAhcF6DoQ2WfJraVpgcKoWcXvMAWUx0pU_9A7UkQz99bCYkx5w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "how a you"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4550.311, "timestamp": "01:15:50", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! Back~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4553.485, "timestamp": "01:15:53", "author": "@Back2005", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TUs_4eRxRjlVzlXUYnX60TXdeAhcF6DoQ2WfJraVpgcKoWcXvMAWUx0pU_9A7UkQz99bCYkx5w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "fine thank you"}]